\]
is required by this HECM splitting implementation. Combined with \(1-\beta_1\le\alpha\), it independently gives \(2/5\). Therefore, **adding descent levels alone does not yield \(L[1/3]\) while retaining this initial HECM splitting pipeline unchanged**.

